msgid "Paired and Trusted Devices"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:52
msgid "Paired Devices"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:53
msgid ""
"Two systems running KuickShare can pair with an 8-digit code, then send to "
"each other without asking. The port 47891 must be reachable."
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:57
msgid "Trusted Devices"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:58
msgid ""
"“Accept and Trust” on a notification accepts a device without asking from "
"then on. It is recognised by name and network address, so only on the same "
"network, never for transfers over Bluetooth, which always ask. Another "
"device on the same network can copy both, so use it only where you trust "
"every device."
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:63
msgid "Wi-Fi Direct (Experimental)"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:69
msgid "Without a Shared Network"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:70
msgid ""
"The transfer starts over Bluetooth and moves to a temporary Wi-Fi link: this "
"system hosts a hotspot to receive, and joins the other device’s Wi-Fi Direct "
"group to send. Turn it on in Preferences; it needs NetworkManager, its "
"dnsmasq package and Bluetooth."
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:74
msgid "On Android"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:75
msgid ""
"Keep Quick Share’s Receive screen open and set to Everyone. A device on the "
"same network as this system is reached over the network instead."
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:79
msgid "Wi-Fi Connection and Firewall"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:80
msgid ""
"With one Wi-Fi card, the normal connection of this system may drop while the "
"temporary link is active. Without firewalld, the device that joins the "
"hotspot can reach every service on this system."
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:85
msgid "Troubleshooting"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:91
msgid "The other device does not see this system"
msgstr ""

#: src/shell/qml/HelpPage.qml:92
